      "@value": "For each variant of Lux Biobank's genotypes, how many people of each population carry it, as CSV. Counts from 1 to 4 are shown as <5; a variant below 5 in every population is left out. Computed by the HDAB when a transfer starts; the genotypes never leave the HDAB.",
